  "_comment": "op-id -> UI section-builder mapping for the Navigator-generated method panel (Spec 1.1). Keyed by the id a PlanStep carries: catalog op-ids for enhancement/segmentation/labels (navigator/data/operation_catalog.json) AND measure-op ids for analysis steps (op_catalog._measure_ops, e.g. 'feature_analysis.cell_analysis'). 'owner' is the attribute on central_manager holding the builder; every _add_* builder lives on the composed ToolboxFunctionsUI (via its mixins), so owner is 'toolbox_functions_ui' throughout. Coverage only grows (tests/navigator/test_section_coverage.py). Add a row only when the builder is verified to exist and to correspond to the op.",
